 [>] 1 Network  [ ] 2 Protection  [ ] 3 Admin  [ ] 4 Recovery  [ ] 5 Sign-in

 Management interface ens192; the product's traffic: ens224.

   1  IPv4       DHCP
   2  IPv6       SLAAC (and RDNSS)
   3  Host name  from DHCP
   4  DNS        from DHCP and router advertisements
   5  NTP        from DHCP

 Type a number to change it, or press Enter to apply these settings.
 They apply live, then the box checks the link, address, gateway, DNS and NTP.

